      "message": "This should be a list of GPIO phandles and should not use `named-gpio` nodes.\n\nThe `cros,aic-pins` driver does this.\n\n[Example usage](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/zephyr/program/ec-aic/npcx-aic/project.overlay;l\u003d33;drc\u003dc37b01cada9fbb953562b91d132befe308506b32)\n\nThe driver code can create an array of GPIOs like this:\n```\nstatic const struct gpio_dt_spec ec_io_gpio[] \u003d {\n        DT_INST_FOREACH_PROP_ELEM_SEP(0, io_gpios, GPIO_DT_SPEC_GET_BY_IDX, (, ))\n    };\n```",
